<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R73cUH079dsK0pNRJiV7Jps> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Business Interruption Insurance Policy" ;
    rdfs:comment "Business interruption insurance compensates for lost income and operating expenses when a business is unable to operate due to a covered event, such as a natural disaster, fire, or other insurable occurrences. This coverage helps to maintain financial stability during periods when normal business operations are adversely affected." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rq6neiK9deZLSfSa41jylg> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R73dveMt11oYotWVGR1ST2F> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Cherries" ;
    rdfs:comment "Cherries are small, round stone fruits from the Prunus genus, characterized by their juicy flesh, smooth skin, and varying flavors from sweet to tart. They are widely consumed fresh, dried, or processed into products like jams, pies, and beverages, valued for their rich antioxidant content, vitamins, and dietary fiber." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8WhsyEOse5TvMLfnHDYfTY> ;
