<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R79ooHwjGKqjqJTzhOxe0To> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Personal Day" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Personal Day is a type of paid time off provided by employers that allows employees to take leave for personal reasons without specifying the nature of the absence. This benefit is typically separate from vacation days or sick leave, offering flexibility for employees to address personal matters, appointments, or mental health needs without detailed explanation." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB2BaikN50BQY375QT0PEWD> ;
