<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R79uvw3nIwtdShCWTu6D5SS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Binge-Eating Disorder" ;
    rdfs:comment "Binge-Eating Disorder is an eating disorder characterized by recurrent episodes of eating large quantities of food in a short period, accompanied by feelings of loss of control during the binge and significant distress or impairment. Unlike Bulimia Nervosa, individuals with Binge-Eating Disorder do not regularly engage in compensatory behaviors such as vomiting or excessive exercise to offset the binge eating." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCfOoWbuAOqLv617rVNcHYh> ;
    skos:altLabel "BED" .

