    rdfs:label "tax_on_tax" ;
    rdfs:comment """\"\"\"Tax-on-Tax"" is a situation where one or more taxes in a tax jurisdiction are based on the sum of the corresponding invoice line item totals AND any other tax amount previously applied to those line item totals. For example, formerly n both Quebec and Prince Edward Island Canada had specific taxes calculated on the sum of the line items plus the federal tax paid on those line items.
