<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7ItETKZAfykvNgICh5RBN4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Chronic Bronchitis" ;
    rdfs:comment "Chronic bronchitis is a type of Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD) characterized by persistent inflammation of the bronchial tubes, leading to a chronic cough and production of mucus over a period of at least three months per year for two consecutive years. This condition results in narrowed airways and impaired airflow, causing difficulty in breathing and frequent respiratory infections." ;
