<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7ItJL7sTHMRx2i7WbPxnik> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Geese" ;
    rdfs:comment "Geese are domesticated waterfowl belonging to the genus Anser and Branta, commonly raised for their meat, eggs, feathers, and down. Known for their grazing habits and strong flocking instincts, geese are often utilized in agriculture for weeding and as guard animals, as well as for their high-quality meat and egg production." ;
