<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7IurUy8ro7uBQ6cHRDnRP8> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Supersedeas Bond Payment Event" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Supersedeas Bond Payment is the payment of a type of surety bond required by a court from an appellant who seeks to delay payment of a judgment until the appeal is resolved. This bond ensures that the appellee will be compensated if the appellant fails to meet the judgment after the appeal." ;
