<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8ZMBn02TENynBiqOlzG7yE> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Genetic Photosensitivity Disorders" ;
    rdfs:comment "Genetic photosensitivity disorders are conditions where an individual's genetic makeup causes an abnormal sensitivity to ultraviolet (UV) light, leading to skin damage upon exposure. These disorders often result in symptoms such as skin lesions, rashes, or an increased risk of skin cancer." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBbkOoA0Hp0UmEnkGJOjs6D> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8ZQ0Km97U2Wut7s0UERyPR> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Levy" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Levy is a legal seizure of property to satisfy a debt, usually initiated by a governmental authority such as the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) for unpaid taxes. The process involves officially taking possession of assets like bank accounts, wages, or physical property, and is typically executed after a court order or other legal authorization" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDKm1RXP9FfvhLzWjynAfpS> .

