    rdfs:label "Real Property Defect Concealed by Seller" ;
    rdfs:comment "The concept of \"Real Property Defect Concealed by Seller\" refers to a situation in which a seller of real estate fails to disclose a known defect in the property to the buyer, which can result in legal claims related to the property and potential liability for the seller." ;
