<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8utefjaPVm1ooWgvWHaZ8p> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Social Anxiety Disorder" ;
    rdfs:comment "Social Anxiety Disorder, also known as social phobia, is a mental health condition characterized by an intense, persistent fear of social or performance situations where one may be scrutinized or judged by others. This fear often leads to significant distress and avoidance of social interactions, affecting daily functioning and quality of life." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDKGeTDagCQ714D5C4sASPP> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8uuvxRrK0Eet2bpHbBGjGp> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Lettuce" ;
    rdfs:comment "Lettuce is a leafy vegetable from the Lactuca sativa species, known for its crisp texture and mild, refreshing flavor. It is commonly consumed raw in salads and sandwiches and is valued for its low-calorie content and nutritional benefits, including vitamins A, C, and K, as well as fiber." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R74NaktGSuv9KJ3aBnw26GP> ;
