<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9CnOvmitM11ptxXIxgCDYT> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Foreign Corporation Financial Disclosure" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Foreign Corporation Financial Disclosure, known in the U.S. as a Form 20-F, is an annual report submitted to the governmental entity (e.g., Securities and Exchange Commission) by foreign private issuers with securities listed on domestic (e.g., U.S.) exchanges. In the United States, the 20-F provides a comprehensive overview of the company's financial position and business operations, including audited financial statements, executive compensation, major shareholders, material risks, and other information required by the SEC." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RmCERXtzdqIJcW9mdbk0Bb> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9CppF8ctgc9584B4NEsb7Y> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Hodgkin Lymphoma" ;
    rdfs:comment "Hodgkin lymphoma is a type of cancer that originates in the lymphatic system, characterized by the presence of Reed-Sternberg cells. It typically begins in the lymph nodes and can spread to other organs, requiring specific treatment approaches distinct from those for non-Hodgkin lymphomas." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCkVEfL4H41pColicGhkXJb> ;
    skos:altLabel "Reed-Sternberg Cell Lymphoma" .

