        "精神无能力",
        "精神的無能力" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB553c218884f3C8f603F6aa> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "U.S. Medicaid and CHIP Payment and Access Commission" ;
    rdfs:comment "The Medicaid and CHIP Payment and Access Commission (MACPAC) is a non-partisan legislative branch agency that provides policy and data analysis and makes recommendations to Congress, the Secretary of the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services, and the states on a wide array of issues affecting Medicaid and the State Children's Health Insurance Program (CHIP). The U.S. Comptroller General appoints MACPAC's 17 commissioners, who come from diverse regions across the United States and bring broad expertise and a wide range of perspectives on Medicaid and CHIP." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R22815eC3Af3bFF0d002Ca58> ;
