<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBQJ0H8haMYmsQGXG1Vl4tf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Climate Stability Rights" ;
    rdfs:comment "Climate Stability Rights pertain to the legal entitlements and principles recognizing the fundamental right of present and future generations to a stable and healthy climate. This concept underscores the obligation of governments, industries, and other entities to take proactive measures to mitigate climate change, reduce greenhouse gas emissions, and preserve the planet's ecological balance. These rights emphasize the importance of intergenerational equity, sustainable development, and global cooperation to ensure a habitable environment for all." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8FLbODQd9k85hPERve6IN7> .

