<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBQUxdVkxYCRp3CYhe9qnyS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "American Call Option Style" ;
    rdfs:comment "An American Call Option Style is an option contract that grants the holder the right to purchase the underlying asset at a specified strike price at any time between the purchase date and the expiration date. This flexibility allows the holder to benefit from favorable price movements in the underlying asset at any point during the option's life." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9pdzW3m7BhNJzoxFi57s70> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBQX9bzOrJ0seTWU1ApWvG> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "UK Electoral Commission" ;
    rdfs:comment "The UK Electoral Commission is an independent regulatory body responsible for overseeing and ensuring the integrity and fairness of elections and referendums in the United Kingdom. It regulates political party funding, monitors compliance with electoral laws, provides guidance and support for voters and electoral administrators, and conducts public awareness campaigns to promote democratic participation." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9AX4LAp7IfL4nFnLZeugyY> .

