<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBQdzQQxF9tJuKhWA3Xv9Ug> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Investment Fund Unit" ;
    rdfs:comment "Investment Fund Unit refers to ownership interests in certain types of investment funds or pooled investment vehicles, such as mutual funds, ETFs, and REITs. Unlike traditional shares in a corporation, units represent a proportional stake in the collective assets of the fund, providing investors with a share of profits, losses, and distributions." ;
