<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBXa7Zas4KaZjtUpwq0RHxv> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Natural Law System" ;
    rdfs:comment "The Natural Law System is a legal philosophy asserting that laws are derived from a set of inherent moral principles and universal truths that govern human behavior, existing independently of human-made laws. It posits that these principles are discoverable through reason and are inherent to human nature, providing a basis for evaluating and guiding positive law." ;
