    rdfs:label "Small Intestine Cancer" ;
    rdfs:comment "Small intestine cancer is a malignant neoplasm originating in the small intestine, which includes the duodenum, jejunum, and ileum. This type of cancer can cause symptoms such as abdominal pain, weight loss, and bowel obstruction and may include various subtypes such as adenocarcinoma, carcinoid tumors, and gastrointestinal stromal tumors (GISTs)." ;
