<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCCbmNM7sKsMbmg25ArBkWu> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Eggplants" ;
    rdfs:comment "Eggplants, also known as aubergines, are fruit vegetables from the Solanum melongena species, characterized by their glossy purple skin and spongy texture. They are widely used in cooking for their ability to absorb flavors and are valued for their fiber content, vitamins, and antioxidants." ;
