<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD0k9FMiaDhDD2ymOcxvUMP> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Negative Pledge Agreement" ;
    rdfs:comment "A \"Negative Pledge Agreement\" is a contractual clause or standalone agreement where a debtor promises not to encumber assets with liens, or offer them as collateral, without the consent of a specific creditor. This agreement aims to protect the unsecured creditor's interests by limiting the debtor's ability to further secure its assets to other creditors." ;
