<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD3AsL6dIQwlCnaA8Rezj3B> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Excessive Bail Claim" ;
    rdfs:comment "An excessive bail claim is a legal action initiated by an individual alleging that their Eighth Amendment right to be free from excessive bail has been violated by the government or a government actor. The Eighth Amendment prohibits the government from imposing excessive bail, which is a monetary sum set by a court to ensure that an individual shows up for trial or other legal proceedings. An excessive bail claim may arise in various contexts, such as when a court sets an unreasonably high bail amount that is beyond the individual's ability to pay, or when a court sets bail at a level that is disproportionate to the offense committed." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RKj3panTdxsJ7nFn11CPGT> ;
    skos:altLabel "Anspruch auf unangemessen hohe Kaution",
        "Excessive Bail Claim",
        "Reclamo de fianza excesiva",
        "Reivindicação de fiança excessiva",
        "Réclamation de caution excessive",
        "תביעת ערבות מופקרת",
        "अत्यधिक जमानत दावा",
        "过度保释要求",
        "過剰保釈請求" .

