<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDOzei3yd81OLmFKtURxjZx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Reverse Mortgage Agreement" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Reverse Mortgage Agreement is a financial contract that allows homeowners, usually seniors, to convert part of their home equity into cash while retaining ownership of their home. Unlike a traditional mortgage, borrowers do not make monthly payments to the lender; instead, the loan amount, along with interest and fees, is repaid when the homeowner sells the property, moves out permanently, or passes away." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R88D8i8AcSTUig2X3yPbFHg> .

