<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDQTeCRD6GnQzgta6LIsizJ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Company Registration for Investors or Traders Petition" ;
    rdfs:comment """A Company Registration for Investors or Traders Petition, in the United States, the company's first E-2 application, allows a company to qualify for the Treaty Investor or Trader category by demonstrating that the company meets the necessary requirements for the status. This initial registration ensures that subsequent applicants from the same company do not need to register again, streamlining future Investors or Traders 
