<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RIOjneXO96zMhlYgGHiovK> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Major Weight-Bearing Joint Surgery" ;
    rdfs:comment "Reconstructive surgery or surgical arthrodesis of a major weight-bearing joint involves surgical procedures aimed at repairing or stabilizing large joints that support significant body weight, such as the hip, knee, or ankle. This type of surgery is performed to restore function, alleviate pain, and improve stability in joints severely affected by injury, disease, or degeneration." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RpiyvcnyPAZ5hygNt0zO3j> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RIPGUOqov5ujn1dMUQF7sZ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Suburban Market Segment" ;
    rdfs:comment "The suburban market segment refers to a group of consumers or businesses located in the suburbs, areas that are typically situated on the outskirts of urban centers and characterized by a mix of residential and commercial zones. This segment is distinguished by its unique lifestyle and consumption patterns, often blending urban convenience with a more spacious and family-oriented environment." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RVu433XojPQPseoDXhidgO> .

