<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RTvhgnc8JDUg9dP9sFve9K> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "European Call Option Style" ;
    rdfs:comment "A European Call Option Style is a type of option contract that can only be exercised for a short, specified period just prior to its expiration, usually on a single day. This restriction contrasts with American-style options, which can be exercised at any time before expiration." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9pdzW3m7BhNJzoxFi57s70> .

