<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RZt6wRozUsGTgVqOixInL5> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Visa for Artist or Entertainer in a Reciprocal Exchange Program" ;
    rdfs:comment "This visa (in the U.S., the P-2 visa) is designed for artists or entertainers who will perform as part of a reciprocal exchange program between an organization in the destination country (e.g., U.S.) and an organization in another country. In the United States, the P-2 visa allows for a temporary stay tied to the duration of the specific performance or event, generally for a period of up to one year, with options for extension" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD1oQDMlC6FytjOndhJTMy8> ;
