<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RehKvgKHQ6yqWnBYOfxzMO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Clearing Title" ;
    rdfs:comment "Clearing title refers to the process of resolving legal issues, claims, or encumbrances that could cloud the ownership status or legal rights associated with a particular property or piece of real estate. This process typically involves investigating and addressing any outstanding liens, disputes, or defects in the property's title to establish a clean and unambiguous ownership status. Clearing title is often necessary when buying or selling real estate to ensure that the buyer receives clear and marketable title to the property." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rxq2qQYpdo9stHOBIQhub7> .

