<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RfrrIqKTh9me3Z5tlVD7Fz> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Testicle Cancer" ;
    rdfs:comment "Testicle cancer, also known as testicular cancer, is a malignant tumor that originates in the tissues of one or both testicles, the male reproductive glands located in the scrotum. It includes various subtypes, such as seminomas and non-seminomas, and can cause symptoms like testicular lumps, swelling, and discomfort, often requiring treatments like surgery, chemotherapy, and radiation." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDF3VrmH1eapfkrSQstevLs> ;
    skos:altLabel "Male Gonadal Cancer" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RftL7w1KHiE4KqKXgdfD8k> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bermudan Call Option Style" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Bermudan Call Option Style is a type of option contract that can be exercised on specific dates during its life, typically more than one date but fewer than the continuous exercise rights of American options. This style offers a middle ground between the flexibility of American options and the strict single-date exercise of European options." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9pdzW3m7BhNJzoxFi57s70> ;
    skos:altLabel "Bermudan-Style Call Option",
