<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RvOCpmr98FwBq1EZ2L86iV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Single Transferable Vote System" ;
    rdfs:comment "The Single Transferable Vote (STV) system is a proportional voting method where voters rank candidates in order of preference. Votes are initially allocated to each voter's first preference, and if a candidate reaches a specified quota, they are elected; any surplus votes are transferred to remaining candidates based on the voters' next preferences, and this process continues until all seats are filled." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RRTsPoZhucp80NJy00WHwY> ;
    skos:altLabel "STV" .

