<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R78PKqeEIORKpYVwEfC4aG4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vote" ;
    rdfs:comment "A vote is the act or process of expressing a choice or preference in a decision-making procedure, often within a formal setting such as an election or a meeting. In democratic systems, voting is the primary mechanism through which citizens influence the selection of their representatives or the outcome of specific issues." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCvV18Mbbb9FYFXbHt1inuL> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R795I9ybqUdayMEcSmyDrG6> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Behavioral Market Segment" ;
    rdfs:comment "A behavioral market segment is a group of consumers classified based on their behavior patterns, including their benefits sought, as well as their usage (of products or services). This segmentation relates to how groups of consumers seek out and interact with products or services." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8UG79BtYP2uqnKNklLYXB8> ;
