    rdfs:label "Reorganization Bankruptcy" ;
    rdfs:comment "This is a process where a company, individual, or any other entity rearranges its debts in order to remain viable. The debtor typically retains their assets and continues to operate the business, while working out a plan to repay creditors over time." ;
