<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCIQhbWQ3g54ivViquznD4o> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Arraignment" ;
    rdfs:comment "Arraignment is a legal event that involves the defendant being brought before a court to hear the charges against them and to enter a plea." ;
