<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCOEo683nGTMlV6VjomHQ8D> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bullying" ;
    rdfs:comment "A bullying claim is a legal assertion that an individual has been subjected to repeated aggressive behavior, typically involving a real or perceived power imbalance. It can occur in various environments, including the workplace, schools, and online, and may involve physical, verbal, or psychological harassment." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9KcDahapJG8vbCxXh6JDwm> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCUXIdFpIxrgm2u6Xlk9ywc> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Dispute Resolution Clause" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Dispute Resolution Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the process for resolving any disagreements or conflicts that may arise between the parties involved, typically through negotiation, mediation, or arbitration." ;
