<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCmRk3EfXQDL2eFl0x659PQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Member" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Member is an individual or entity that holds an ownership or participatory interest in an organization or association. In business contexts, such as in a Limited Liability Company (LLC), members contribute capital or assets, and share in the management and profits according to organizational agreements." ;
