    rdfs:comment "Claims by Real Estate Agents and Brokers refer to legal actions taken by these professionals in order to receive compensation for their services, such as commissions on exclusive listings or breach of implied covenant of good faith and fair dealing, in relation to property and premises liability claims." ;
