    rdfs:comment "\"NOS\" = Not Otherwise Specified (catch-all, includes the subcategories). Activities or actions to associated with supervising or managing specific activities or actions throughout the EDRM continuum such as conducting meetings and team calls, developing work plans, budgets, forecasts, reports and other meaningful activities or for general project management not associated with a particular \"L\" code. Primarily charges on a hourly or a flat/fixed fee basis." ;
