<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8JVOGBEzEQHWl2bYk4uQam> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Patent Assessment Process" ;
    rdfs:comment "The patent assessment process is a systematic investigation conducted to ascertain the novelty and non-obviousness of an invention by examining existing patents and other relevant technical literature. This process is crucial for determining the likelihood of obtaining a patent and avoiding infringement of existing patents." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD3LBDAXqjURNXVGHaWXf7s> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8KhmyuiGXDz10apLAPbLJV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "HIV / AIDS" ;
    rdfs:comment "HIV (Human Immunodeficiency Virus) is a virus that attacks the body's immune system, specifically the CD4 cells (T cells), leading to a weakened immune response. If not treated, HIV can progress to AIDS (Acquired Immunodeficiency Syndrome), the final stage of HIV infection, where the immune system is severely damaged, and the body becomes vulnerable to opportunistic infections and cancers." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/REFNhmFYG6yk3W0RPLFV6g> ;
    skos:altLabel "Immunodeficiency Virus Infection" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8M0UJWeEVpeK5gMPLTQSl2> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Estate Planning Objectives" ;
    rdfs:comment "Estate Planning Objectives refer to the goals and purposes that individuals aim to achieve when organizing their assets, properties, and financial affairs for the future distribution upon their death. These objectives ensure the proper management and transfer of wealth, fulfillment of personal wishes, and minimization of taxes and legal complications." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCDwLiS22z6MzQaQHS08hvk> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8REFEtDy732ovlT7nI0DGr> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Gasoline Stations and Fuel Dealers Industry" ;
    rdfs:comment "Industries in the Gasoline Stations and Fuel Dealers subsector retail automotive fuels (e.g., gasoline, diesel fuel, gasohol, alternative fuels) and automotive oils, without or in combination with convenience store items; or retail heating oil, liquefied petroleum (LP) gas, and other fuels via direct selling (i.e., home delivery).  Gasoline stations have specialized equipment for storing and dispensing automotive fuels." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDfdmGR6iPi4k2t6ecIUBkP> ;
    skos:altLabel "GASS",
        "Gasoline Stations",
