<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8f4qGdjxuiQary8OBpq8W9> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Industry and Market" ;
    rdfs:comment "Industry and markets refer to the collective sectors and segments within an economy that produce, distribute, and sell goods and services. This encompasses various industries such as agriculture, technology, and finance, as well as different market segments like luxury goods, budget services, and regional businesses" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8fSoRbI3U75OLeBvp4PzG2> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Publisher" ;
    rdfs:comment "A publisher is an individual, group, or organization responsible for producing and distributing printed or digital content, such as books, newspapers, magazines, or software. Publishers oversee the editorial, production, and marketing processes to bring a work from manuscript or concept to a finished, available product" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8eT1bTptg5J6ZfnwSUQYpf> .

