<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8ibMTtrBCWGIGOeFjTLtL0> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Correctional Facility - Real Estate Asset" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Correctional Facility includes properties specifically designed, constructed, and operated to confine individuals who have been arrested, are awaiting trial, or have been convicted of crimes. These assets encompass a range of facilities, including prisons, jails, detention centers, and penitentiaries, and are critical components of the criminal justice system." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RUhSbbDJZa8Crs3tIWcIfV> ;
