<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8o77OqyndqK7R237rr61yE> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Unconscionability Permitting Contract Rescission" ;
    rdfs:comment "Unconscionability Permitting Contract Rescission refers to the legal concept that allows a contract to be cancelled or voided due to the presence of unfair or oppressive terms or circumstances that make it impossible for one party to fully understand or consent to the agreement." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDP2t75tSvlsq1GCrOZlInL> ;
