<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R92zfYLbJJuyDTDnDtJOrLx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Ejectment" ;
    rdfs:comment "A legal action to remove a person or entity from a property they wrongfully possess, typically involving a claim of ownership by the plaintiff." ;
