<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R981K5l1Ju5uHj4jVRSUCJQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Failure to Provide Employment Records Claim" ;
    rdfs:comment "A failure to provide employment records claim is a legal action initiated by an employee against their employer for not furnishing access to, or copies of, certain employment documents as required by law. These documents may include payroll records, timekeeping data, or personnel files, and the claim typically arises when an employer either refuses or neglects to provide the requested information within the specified time frame mandated by applicable laws." ;
