        "雇用記録提供不履行請求" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9847SXyPLJAgrYHCLthP56> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Malicious Prosecution" ;
    rdfs:comment "The concept of Malicious Prosecution refers to the intentional and wrongful use of legal process against another person, without probable cause and with malice, resulting in damages to the victim." ;
