        "恶意起诉",
        "悪質な起訴" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R996WtCH3h9VroTEbPc4hpS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Suspension" ;
    rdfs:comment "Suspension refers to the temporary removal of a person or entity from a position, privilege, or right as a disciplinary measure or precaution. This can occur in various contexts, including education, employment, and government contracts, often pending further investigation or resolution of an issue." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R6DLuG3VglXIci9EJ3MwAK> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R99UNWpuiCUIJXZnQbuFLRq> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "tax_tier_summary segment" ;
    rdfs:comment """"Summarizes the Tiered Taxes charged on this matter/invoice detailed in TAX_TIER_DETAIL by tx_id.  There will be 0 or more TAX_TIER_SUMMARY segments per INVOICE segment.  There will be 1 TAX_TIER_SUMMARY segment for each TAX.tx_id where TAX.'tax_tiers = ""Y"".

Note that the EXTEND_HEADER option was purposely omitted from this segment.
\"""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RC3hDYvR4ffxmqJg2F8YGT6> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9BC2mdYLFmSyLcCkV4odRX> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Nature Reserve" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Nature Reserve is a designated area of land set aside for the protection and conservation of biodiversity, natural resources, and/or specific species. This type of real estate asset typically falls under specific environmental regulations and is often managed by government bodies or non-profit organizations" ;
