<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9DCJMzRXnPZMWQqQuPLECx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Gender-Based Market Segment" ;
    rdfs:comment "Gender-based market segments refer to divisions of the market that are categorized based on the gender of consumers. These segments allow businesses to tailor their products, services, and marketing strategies to cater to the specific needs, preferences, and behaviors of different gender groups, such as men, women, and non-binary individuals." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7KxYUBMSAuzPHdBhWfPSv7> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9H8B4LW9PpywsdO2cXejL9> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Broadcast Timing Attributes" ;
    rdfs:comment "Broadcast Timing Attributes refer to the characteristics that define the timing of broadcast transmissions, distinguishing between content that is delivered in real-time and content that is pre-recorded and scheduled for later playback. These attributes categorize broadcasts into synchronous (live) and asynchronous (pre-recorded) transmissions." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8mCB7w7tqtq6yOWvTxdMJI> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9HYiwtnrCegkpzpKHbJSRW> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Estate, Inheritance, and Gift Tax Payment" ;
    rdfs:comment "Estate, Inheritance, and Gift Taxes are levies imposed on the transfer of wealth through various means, either during a person's life or upon their death. Estate taxes are applied to the total value of a deceased person's estate before distribution to heirs, inheritance taxes are imposed on beneficiaries receiving assets, and gift taxes are applied to transfers of wealth during an individual's lifetime that exceed certain thresholds." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBVCwr551O94R7T2y8aKsPS> ;
    skos:altLabel "Death and Gift Tax Payment",
        "Inheritance and Gift Tax Payment",
        "Transfer Tax Payment",
        "Wealth Transfer Tax Payment" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9Hh6KeMR56ynN9kPCNDHTl> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Writ of Mandamus" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Writ of Mandamus is a legal order issued by a court that commands a government official or agency to perform a specific duty or act that they are legally obligated to do." ;
