<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9JJWlci2GwDGSMqF9e5IiW> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vehicle Equipment Violation Claim" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Vehicle Equipment Violation Claim involves allegations that a vehicle's equipment does not meet the regulatory standards required by law, which may include issues with lighting, brakes, tires, or emissions controls. These claims are crucial for ensuring road safety and environmental compliance, and they can result in mandatory repairs, fines, or other enforcement actions." ;
