<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBdRbQ6LheYkEvM4LBGBHps> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Post-Closing Covenants" ;
    rdfs:comment "\"Post-Closing Covenants\" are promises or obligations that parties agree to adhere to after the completion of a transaction, such as a merger. In merger agreements, these covenants typically address ongoing commitments, actions, or restrictions to ensure a smooth transition and integration, or to protect the interests of the involved parties after the deal has closed." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8S6XHMUuU5cg5gdDri7LuL> .

