    rdfs:label "Monarch" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Monarch is a sovereign head of state, typically a king or queen, who reigns over a country or territory by hereditary right or election. This individual holds a position of supreme authority within a monarchy, often serving as both the ceremonial figurehead and, in some cases, an active participant in governance." ;
