<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDkKltCs6qv3E5GLBaSJ8H4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Election" ;
    rdfs:comment "An election is a formal decision-making process in which eligible individuals, often referred to as voters, select a choice or representative from among multiple candidates or options. Elections are used in democracies to fill various public offices or decide on legislation and public policy issues, ensuring that the will of the people is reflected in governance and leadership." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCvV18Mbbb9FYFXbHt1inuL> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDlMwQ5nSrgZMByjzjtXnUO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Government Representative" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Government Representative refers to any individual who acts on behalf of a governmental body, whether they are an elected official, an appointed official, or a regular employee. The term encompasses a wide range of roles, from high-ranking government officials who make policy decisions to government employees who carry out administrative tasks, all serving the interests of the state or public they represent." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD2KAbcnrk0vfpUCEog3N9F> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDlUNUSYsLydg1YtgDPDCk5> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Farmland" ;
