<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDroRAFhNybTCHv1WlHGerL> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employment Warning" ;
    rdfs:comment "An Employment Warning is a formal notice issued by an employer to an employee, indicating that their behavior or performance is unacceptable and needs improvement. This warning serves as an official record of the issue and a step in the disciplinary process." ;
