<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RaQIRktfYrGWDS7HAq0N6f> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Donation" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Donation is a voluntary gift of money, goods, services, or property given to an individual, organization, or cause without expectation of reciprocation or direct personal benefit. This act of giving is typically motivated by altruism, support for a specific mission or goal, or a desire to contribute to societal well-being." ;
