<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RjM80CC0FA0G2sKxmlbaJF> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Buyer" ;
    rdfs:comment "A buyer or purchaser generally means a person, company or entity contracting with a seller for services or merchandise to be provided or delivered for a named individual. In a strict legal sense, a buyer may also include someone who acquires title to something by deed, devise, execution, prescription, possession, occupancy, or escheat." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCEDL3kMYgjFUEOhOyGp3IE> ;
