<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RlZdd14uUrCvqa8YJ7RzNd> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Authorship" ;
    rdfs:comment "Authorship, particularly human authorship in copyright law, designates the creation of a work by a human being, attributing legal rights and responsibilities to the creator. This principle recognizes the human creator as the source of intellectual creativity and grants them exclusive rights over their work." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8O3PoolmgHAy2hrZsguhqy> .

