<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rr7unN3nXmcbbkDTbDWiwb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Article 3 Claim" ;
    rdfs:comment "An Article III claim pertains to a legal argument based on Article III of the U.S. Constitution, which establishes the judicial branch of the federal government. Such a claim may arise in disputes over federal court jurisdiction, the interpretation of federal laws, or the constitutionality of legislation or executive actions." ;
