<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R0TZk2qCI4HPwDl3e9FoOo> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Human Rights" ;
    rdfs:comment "Human rights refer to the fundamental rights and freedoms to which all individuals are inherently entitled, regardless of nationality, sex, ethnicity, religion, or other characteristics. These rights are often upheld by international law and treaties, and they include, but are not limited to, the right to life, liberty, and security of person, as well as freedom from torture and discrimination." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9PYNVVb9kMDcRtGNPADrO5> .

