<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7NkMt6XJKd4fSolKqqOy5B> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "General Sales and Consumption Tax Payment" ;
    rdfs:comment "General Sales and Consumption Tax Payment includes all taxes, other than import and export duties, levied on the production, leasing, transfer, delivery, or sale of a wide range of goods and the rendering of a wide range of services. These taxes apply to both domestically produced and imported goods, irrespective of the stage of production or distribution at which they are levied. This category covers value-added taxes, sales taxes, and multi-stage cumulative taxes, including adjustments for border transactions." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7f6bqEjMQDMYjlvg0WINGf> ;
    skos:altLabel "Comprehensive Sales Tax Payment",
