<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8TmxqBbWaNgdm0lJQdY6D4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Pension and Benefits Claims" ;
    rdfs:comment "Pension and benefits claims are legal actions initiated by an employee against their employer for not complying with applicable laws or the terms of an employment agreement regarding retirement and other benefits. These claims can involve issues such as the mismanagement or mishandling of employee pension or retirement accounts, denial or reduction of employee benefits, or failure to provide required benefits such as health insurance or disability coverage. Employees may also bring pension and benefits claims if their employer retaliates against them for asserting their rights to these benefits." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCty0MaQzrLC9KnzjM7nMER> ;
    skos:altLabel "Benefits Claims",
