    rdfs:label "Financial Obligations" ;
    rdfs:comment "Financial Obligations (Financial Liabilities) refer to any monetary commitments or liabilities an individual or entity is responsible for, such as paying off debts, fulfilling contract terms, or covering recurring expenses. These obligations can be short-term or long-term and failing to meet them could result in financial penalties or legal consequences" ;
