<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCZmEz3VSzAcKpjGH5Wu1ir> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Change of Recommendation Trigger" ;
    rdfs:comment "Change of Recommendation Trigger refers to a provision in a fiduciary exemption to a change of recommendation covenant or a breakup fee trigger that allows for a change in the recommendation of a merger or acquisition based on certain events or circumstances." ;
