<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCcQHyZbjBHsXsm0zrZGme5> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Tortious Interference Claims" ;
    rdfs:comment "Tortious Interference Claims refer to legal claims made by a party against another for intentionally interfering with their contractual or business relationships, resulting in economic harm or loss." ;
