<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RKj3panTdxsJ7nFn11CPGT> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "8th Amendment Claim" ;
    rdfs:comment "An Eighth Amendment claim is a legal argument asserting that an individual's constitutional protection against cruel and unusual punishment, as guaranteed by the Eighth Amendment of the United States Constitution, has been violated. Such claims typically involve disputes over the conditions of confinement, the use of excessive force, or the imposition of excessive fines or bail, and aim to protect the basic human rights and dignity of individuals subject to punishment or detention." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "8. Änderungsantrag Anspruch",
        "8th Amendment Claim",
        "8वीं संशोधन दावा",
        "Reclamo de la Octava Enmienda",
        "Reivindicação da 8ª Emenda",
        "Réclamation de 8ème amendement",
        "תביעה על התיקון השמיני",
        "第8修正案の主張",
        "第八修正案索赔" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RLNlm7nXyJQLJmk8qYnaPQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Indemnification" ;
    rdfs:comment "Indemnification is a legal remedy sought by a party to be protected from financial loss or liability resulting from a specific event or action, and may be implied or granted by contract or court order." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDbz1PVc6y57oOb9jAIl0eN> ;
    skos:altLabel "Haftungsfreistellung",
