        "Indemnity",
        "Indemnización",
        "Indenização",
        "פיצויים",
        "भरपाई",
        "免責",
        "赔偿" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RLoMwtVZOH407TSzI4gtgp> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employment Leave" ;
    rdfs:comment "\"Employment Leave\" refers to authorized periods of time when an employee is permitted to be absent from work while retaining their employment status. This can include various types of leave, such as vacation leave, sick leave, parental leave, or other forms of time off that employees may be entitled to based on their employment contracts or labor laws." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBila9ckW95W84Tk54tGfZO> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RM8uFdNbkVDabwW32Bv8E> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Religious Law System" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Religious Law System is a legal framework grounded in religious beliefs, texts, and traditions, governing both the moral and legal aspects of the lives of its adherents. These systems derive their authority from sacred scriptures and religious institutions, and often encompass both private conduct and public law." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RVPwUkNgWhlwyYWWSPrLuZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Divine Law",
        "Sacred Law",
        "Theocratic Legal System" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RMo0rWec8owXGDAYl6PGNG> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Concurrent Interest" ;
    rdfs:comment "Concurrent Interest refers to the situation where two or more parties simultaneously hold ownership interests in the same piece of property. This type of ownership includes various forms such as joint tenancy, tenancy in common, and tenancy by the entirety, each with distinct legal implications regarding the rights of the owners." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8cjnXHiv1wNe6nzPvWnhQw> ;
    skos:altLabel "Dual Ownership",
        "Shared Ownership",
        "Simultaneous Ownership" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RNICD9MDcFQJJX6nxX11Vt> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Legal Proposition" ;
    rdfs:comment "A legal proposition is a statement that outlines a principle, rule, or application of law that arguably applies to a particular legal matter, usually in writing. Legal propositions are foundational components of legal arguments, supported by statutes, case law, or other legal authorities to persuade a stakeholder (e.g., decisionmaker, opposing counsel, a counterparty) to reach a particular conclusion." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R77n3Z14OcgllZTAx8sw9xZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Legal Argument",
        "Legal Proposition",
        "Point of Law",
        "Proposición legal",
        "הצעת חוק",
        "कानूनी प्रस्ताव" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RNUBxUepOEIOvagLHcD3N0> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Extraordinary Ability Non-Immigrant Visa Types" ;
    rdfs:comment "An O visa is issued to foreign nationals with extraordinary ability in the sciences, arts, education, business, or athletics, allowing them to enter the U.S. to continue work in their field. This visa category includes O-1 for individuals with extraordinary ability, O-2 for essential support personnel, and O-3 for their immediate family members." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD1oQDMlC6FytjOndhJTMy8> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RNkhUYPhiQvGHbAYwX9XKIg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "L620 Collection (NOS)" ;
