    rdfs:comment "The population density market segment classifies consumers or businesses based on the density of people in their geographic area, such as urban, rural, or suburban regions. This segmentation helps businesses understand and address the varying needs, preferences, and purchasing behaviors of customers living in areas with different levels of population concentration." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7z0ey8ZMeOT1q01VNPe1HY> .

