<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RfDzMtuMPdmNTonmhBxu> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Lease" ;
    rdfs:comment "A Lease Agreement is a binding contract between a lessor (the owner) and a lessee (the renter) that stipulates the terms and conditions for renting out an asset, such as real estate property or an automobile. The agreement outlines details like the rental amount, lease duration, responsibilities of each party, and other specific provisions related to the rented asset." ;
