<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8aVRgLAjmuf0OiloIoc9pm> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Semi-Proportional Electoral System" ;
    rdfs:comment "A semi-proportional electoral system is a voting method that seeks to balance majority rule with proportional representation, allowing for more accurate reflection of voter preferences while still favoring larger parties. Examples include limited voting, cumulative voting, single non-transferable vote, and modified Borda count, which each employ different mechanisms to achieve this balance." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7OQ65vKuOBSSGgSVYnoMfx> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8cGjHXv3vecVd4ZO6HVjo> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Immigration Processing Types" ;
    rdfs:comment "\"Immigration processing type\" refers to the specific stage or procedure within the immigration process, such as visa applications, port of entry checks, change of status requests, or extensions, each with its own requirements and documentation. These steps are crucial for determining an individual's eligibility for entry, residency, or other immigration-related benefits in a destination country." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9ODLnhxFt38FQNV4BUbRSD> .

