    rdfs:comment "An association refers to an organized group of individuals or entities that join together for a common purpose or goal. These groups can take various forms, and they often have specific missions, objectives, and membership requirements. Associations are commonly established to promote shared interests, advocacy, networking, and collaboration among their members." ;
