    rdfs:label "Status - Process Outcome" ;
    rdfs:comment "Status Process Outcome reflects the result or disposition of a particular process or action — at a particular point in time — often indicating the decision or outcome of an application, request, or submission within a legal or regulatory context. This status conveys the relevant authority's determination, such as \"approved,\" \"denied,\" \"received,\" \"responded,\" or \"withdrawn.\"" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rx69EnEj3H3TpcgTfUSoYx> .

