<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8Tktpdf3HuYd3nI7nf9xQU> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Psychographic Market Segment" ;
    rdfs:comment "Psychographic market segment refers to divisions of the market that are categorized based on what consumers think about and value, as well as how they live their lives, including consumers' specific interests, preferences, and passions. This category includes consumers who share a common interest or enthusiasm for particular products, services, activities, or priorities. These segments include areas like health-conscious, tech segment, sustainability segment, and others." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8UG79BtYP2uqnKNklLYXB8> ;
    skos:altLabel "Consumer Interest Segments",
