<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9ihoRPcnCIxjpGoNYzMi2Y> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Public Health Insurance Policy" ;
    rdfs:comment "Public health insurance is a government-sponsored program designed to provide healthcare coverage to eligible individuals or populations. Examples in the United States include Medicare, for older adults, and Medicaid, for low-income individuals. Coverage and eligibility criteria are determined by the government." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCjgFvO2VxpIklnhZMbSD9k> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9jGsr6LEcgGQxDRMlckOMm> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Mineral Rights" ;
    rdfs:comment "Mineral rights pertain to the ownership and control of the minerals (like coal, oil, and gas) beneath a plot of land. The owner of mineral rights can lease, sell, or transfer these rights to others." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCkPc0XIMxDInzRipCUUZ1q> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9pQxz2fUIrk1LjvVP8hikg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Enforcement of Judgment" ;
    rdfs:comment "The enforcement of judgment refers to the legal process of ensuring that a court's decision is carried out, often through methods such as seizing assets or placing liens on property." ;
