<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCxI8cqNSzWB8ZAuv6RBHmV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Proceeding Status" ;
    rdfs:comment "\"Proceeding Status\" refers to the current stage or status of a legal or regulatory process, whether it's a court proceeding or a regulatory proceeding. It signifies whether the proceeding is open, closed, consolidated, inactive, or has had filing fees waived." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rx69EnEj3H3TpcgTfUSoYx> .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD3LBDAXqjURNXVGHaWXf7s> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Patent Registration Process" ;
    rdfs:comment "The Patent Registration Process involves submitting an application to a patent office, such as the United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO), which includes a written description of the invention, claims defining the scope of protection, and often drawings. The application undergoes examination for novelty, non-obviousness, and usefulness; if approved, a Patent Registration Document is issued, granting the applicant exclusive rights to the invention for a set period, usually 20 years from the filing date" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCjBhn4sl7PeEM1RmLQ3pT0> ;
    skos:altLabel "Patent Application Process",
        "Patent Procurement",
        "Patent Prosecution",
        "Patenting Process" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD3TwEtezlhaJxwaSHCibko> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bankruptcy Plans" ;
    rdfs:comment "A bankruptcy plan is a legal document that outlines the proposed financial restructuring or liquidation of a bankrupt entity, including the distribution of assets and repayment of debts, as required by the specific chapter of the bankruptcy code under which the entity is filing." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8zijLH2GH0SxOhIdzeDOs3> ;
    skos:altLabel "Bankruptcy Plans",
