<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDAtMRi4dBGNW1PytkqmH4t> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Diabetes" ;
    rdfs:comment "Diabetes is a chronic health condition characterized by high levels of glucose in the blood due to the body's inability to produce or effectively use insulin. It requires ongoing management through lifestyle changes, medication, and regular monitoring to prevent complications." ;
