        "第14修正案索赔",
        "第14改正請求" .

<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDu2iPpQAdciNSirAd52mw4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Endocrine Disorders" ;
    rdfs:comment "Endocrine disorders involve conditions that affect the endocrine glands, which produce hormones regulating various physiological processes in the body, including metabolism, growth, and reproduction. These disorders can disrupt hormonal balance, leading to a wide range of symptoms and health issues." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RD12xMI38C0qkkx19ISgWWD> ;
