<https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCeEdzen5sS4qh0lfvncqh7> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Allied Legal Professional" ;
    rdfs:comment "An allied legal professional supports the delivery of legal services through specialized skills and knowledge. These professionals work in various roles, such as paralegals, law librarians, and legal marketing personnel, all enabling legal service providers (e.g., law firms) to deliver legal services." ;
